+---------------------+
|     Code (.text)    | ← Machine instructions (executable, read-only)
+---------------------+
|     Constants       | ← Read-only strings "..." (.rodata)
+---------------------+
|   Global data       | ← Initialised global variables (.data)
+---------------------+
| Uninitialised data  | ← Uninitialised global variables (.bss)
+---------------------+
|       Heap          | ← malloc(), calloc(), realloc() (grows upwards)
+---------------------+
|       Stack         | ← local variables, function calls (grows downwards)
+---------------------+

-- Lifetime and access --
Data type           Allocation   Lifetime                      Access
int a;              Stack        until the end of the block     fast (offset)
static int a;       .data/.bss   until the end of the program   global (address)
char *s = "abc";    .rodata      until the end of the program   read-only
int *p = malloc();  Heap         until free()                   manual
const int c = 4;    .rodata      until the end of the program   read-only
global int g;       .data/.bss   until the end of the program   global
